Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,=======TEXT=======
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.23,0:00:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}丝毫没有在反省的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.99,0:00:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}今后也没有打算想改变态度
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你这样的地方可以说是你的特点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是我丑话说在前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我可是非常头疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}如果你再做出上次那样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}就会与我的剧本背道而驰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好了 你可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么 今天要做的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.29,0:02:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}安那其？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}御宅英雄是怎么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}关于Slayer或者其他什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.51,0:02:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}没人告诉过我们会出现那样的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}嗯 我也是吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}难道说 你是因为担心我才来看我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}啊 对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.23,0:03:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}因为接下来的战斗会比以往的都更加艰辛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.13,0:03:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那就和大家一起加油努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不要啊 别再说那些羞耻的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.29,0:03:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是 我也感觉放松了许多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}想让她用魔法修复这个坏掉的玩具什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但现在不是说这个的氛围啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.44,0:03:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}能修好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}树脂部件因紫外线照射和增塑剂泄漏而恶化了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.83,0:03:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}当你摆弄这些玩具和模型时 这些损耗是不可避免的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.11,0:03:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}当他们被磨损之后 并且开始变得不灵活时
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.51,0:03:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}就会发涩 变硬 就会变得更加容易坏…掉？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我的话 更喜欢硬硬的而不是疲软的哟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那种话就打住吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.62,0:04:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}所以这个 能修好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}治疗魔法 可是我的专长哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.73,0:04:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么 就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}哇 太厉害了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}怎么 怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现在的玩具做的是真精良啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}Pink 你给他注射了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}能自动修复树脂部分的药
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.57,0:04:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}怎么看也不像仅仅是那样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}加上人参 毒蛇灵药蜂王浆 还有少量魔力
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.34,0:04:55.16,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}够了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.77,0:05:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现在是要问你丢的是金高丁还是银高丁的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.35,0:05:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么重要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我可是努力打工存够了钱 才只买了一个二手的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.94,0:05:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这里是我们的地盘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不允许外人随意进入
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你们谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.65,0:05:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们就是驻扎在这秋叶原解放区的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}万世桥御宅公社
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好土啊 这些大叔怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}和我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.35,0:05:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}是从SHOBON手里逃到这解放区 然后聚集在一起的一帮人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}所以说我们不应该是一条船上的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但显然他们不太欢迎我们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.79,0:05:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你是想说 「同室操戈」之类的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们同是御宅族 关系理应很好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}对啊 大家请听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.67,0:05:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我不是为战争而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.03,0:05:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我只是想拿回我掉在河里的高丁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:05:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.83,0:06:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}三年前 骚乱之时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.82,0:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我和我情同手足的兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为了保护我们的财富不被没收
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们把他们全部扔进了神田川中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}也就是说这条神田川中沉睡着各种各样的历史文物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}是秋叶原的遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你只是在找借口抢走我们的宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.70,0:06:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}阁下根本不清楚他们的真实价值
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.65,0:06:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你还打算把他们在网上卖了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}露馅了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.27,0:06:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}搞错了 搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们除了用武力强取 别无他法了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}本想看看这里聚一群人是想干什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}净是臭臭的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我还是挺喜欢大叔的味道的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}没人问你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我不管宝物是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但河流是大家共有的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.51,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}什么样的成年人会独占它啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}滚啊 魔法少女
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.33,0:06:50.23,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}秋叶原的灾星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}挺敢说的啊 中年老东西们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}找打吗 小家伙们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好了 够了够了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.29,0:07:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现在他们不是我们要战斗的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那我们不管高丁了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.77,0:07:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸 住手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这 这声音 是你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸 不要再做这种事了 赶紧回家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}嘁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}妈妈也很担心你的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我不是跟你说过了不要来这吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}优美
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.24,0:07:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我叫舞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不要再用我出生前的动画角色的名字来叫我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.61,0:07:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸 我也一直很担心你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.72,0:07:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}在下已经没有归家的想法了是也
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.12,0:07:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我说别再用「在下 是也」这种羞耻的词语了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}麻美也赶紧回家去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为什么要用那种名字啊 我叫柚啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸 适可而止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}所以说啊
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.81,0:07:50.87,Default2,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你什么时候才能成熟一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们到底在看什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这算是丢下了家人然后来到了这里的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:08:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我才不管他们是结婚了还是有孩子了 都没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.25,0:08:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}只要我们被压迫了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.95,0:08:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们就有作为御宅族而战斗的觉悟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那份觉悟是一样的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}对啊 是一样的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}毕竟我们都是御宅族
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.66,0:08:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那究竟是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们没办法与他们正常沟通呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那种事情很简单吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}Blue？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}从最早开始就有的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}能让关系变缓和的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.99,0:08:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}观众朋友们 大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现在为您带来的是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}悸动！神田川净是魔法少女游泳大会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}说不定能有些色色的场面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.78,0:08:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}会把你打倒的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}御宅族革命军是干劲满满啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.79,0:08:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}另一方 御宅族公社是？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}游泳大会真是个老气的想法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}把在下也带回了青春的80年代是也
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}等等 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为什么连我们也
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为什么我要穿成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}做得好 麻美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}也是干劲满满
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为什么选游泳大会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}古人曾云「肌肤相亲 情之至也」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.09,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}很久以前 神田川中充满了工业废物和生活排水
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}因为里面没有任何生物 甚至被称为死水
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是在1987年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.61,0:09:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}落合水资源再生中心开始高度重视此问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}像是看走眼了一般 又把水质变得清澈见底了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.92,0:09:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}让游泳大会的召开成为了可能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.49,0:09:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这样子？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么 第一回合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}{\fad(0,1000)}摇曳水上障碍物竞走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}参赛选手要穿过水上浮岛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}并清除各种障碍物后到达终点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么 请选手各就位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}预备
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.96,0:09:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}冲啊 Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.40,0:10:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}冲吧 吾儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}加油 麻美
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.69,0:10:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}出发
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.34,0:10:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}啊 都在看着我 都在看着我这娇羞的姿态
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}请用 请用那燥热的眼神来注视着我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.06,0:10:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}再多来一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为什么是这种眼神
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}是人家 输了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}公社胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}可恶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这算什么胜利啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.37,0:10:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么 下一轮是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.89,0:10:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}左摇?! 右晃?! 水上相扑~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:11:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}{\an8}东力士 舞富士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}{\an8}西力士 朝桃龙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}上啊 Pink
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}有什么不对劲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么 双手触地
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}加油 加油 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}加油 加油 加油 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不可能赢的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.29,0:11:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}胜者 朝桃龙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.28,0:11:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}有个这样的东西浮起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.76,0:11:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那是Pink的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.01,0:11:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}用来维持健康的药物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}诶 虽说朝桃龙取得了胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.39,0:11:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但因为违反比赛的无兴奋剂规则
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.06,0:11:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}胜者是舞富士
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}做到了啊 爱蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.55,0:11:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}Pink
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}绝对不许用兴奋剂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}接下来 是最终回
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}糅合！水中骑马战
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}赢了这场比赛得三分 所以也有可能被翻盘哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:12:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么 领军各就位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}开始…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.08,0:12:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}之前 先进一段广告
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.55,0:12:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}欢迎回到我们的比赛现场
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}您现在收看的是 糅合！水中骑马战
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}获胜条件是 抢走骑士的帽子 或者打将骑士下水
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.69,0:12:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那么 各就位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.28,0:12:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}预备
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}开戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们上 Blue Pink
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}安那其 靠你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.73,0:12:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.42,0:12:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}可恶 两个人不公平啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为什么我要来做这种事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我坚信 这场战斗一定能让你们敞开心扉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们和你们的从根本上就不同
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.42,0:12:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我不清楚那些东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.85,0:12:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}到底为什么 到底我们之间有什么差异
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}如果你不知道的话 我来告诉你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}御宅族现在是获得认可的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.14,0:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你可以把它与其他的爱好一起说出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是曾经的御宅族
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}是别人都避之不及的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.25,0:13:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}只能偷偷地 在下水道一样的世界里活动
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们为了能收集情报而不被世人所发现
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}只能掩目遮面去买谷
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}而如果你碰巧被别人认识
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.59,0:13:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}「真恶心」之类的标签就会被贴到你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.13,0:13:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们是从这样艰难的时期活过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.09,0:13:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}然而
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现在的御宅族
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不费吹灰之力就能得到谷的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}在阳光之下自由自在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}就连以御宅族的身份而幸福这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.85,0:13:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}都能发自内心宣告出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}就像是我的兴趣是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}「我并不讨厌哦」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现在净是这般景象
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.60,0:13:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是现在的御宅族也是被迫害的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}所以我们之间的斗争没有意义
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}被迫害的原因 也正是你们这些御宅族误会而导致的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}醒醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}御宅族就不是能在阳光下出现的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:13:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}什么「御宅文化」 什么「秋叶原文化」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.65,0:14:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为什么还想不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}拿不到居民权的你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.62,0:14:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}还是在整天整夜地幻想
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}等等 御宅英雄 要倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.64,0:14:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}难道说这一切都是我们导致的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.49,0:14:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}说真的 我们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们也不想离开我们的家来到这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.11,0:14:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}所言极是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}在下因为那件事 向家人表明了自己是御宅族
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.36,0:14:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}喜欢动漫 喜欢特摄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}更喜欢五颜六色头发的魔法少女们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}储藏室里还保存着当时的海报
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}店面流行乐 戏剧唱片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}听到这些的家人的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}至今在我的脑海中挥之不去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不是 你早就已经暴露得差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你还说「在下盂兰盆节和年底要去台场」就离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}如果没有这样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我就不会失去家人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}所以说现在与过去不同
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}看动画的时候 买谷的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.76,0:15:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}没有了麻烦不是应该更加高兴吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}御宅族不必在这世间鬼鬼祟祟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}还应该
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}堂堂正正地抬起头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}难道 这就是年轻人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.70,0:15:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}炫目十分是也
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.21,0:15:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好啊 好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}就是这个劲头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}而且比起现在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.43,0:15:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们拥有前所未有的魔法少女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}既然喜欢魔法少女的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}就和这现实中的三位魔法少女一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}夺回那个喜欢的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}可笑至极
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}魔法少女只存在于动漫中 漫画中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}只是在架空的世界中闪闪发光的东西罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现实中存在的魔法少女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.83,0:15:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}连点亮小灯泡的力量都没有乎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.31,0:15:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.81,0:15:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}她们不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这些家伙在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.97,0:15:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这回反而奏效了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}稳住啊 御宅英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}御宅英雄大人 振作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.04,0:16:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}御宅族革命军危机了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.10,0:16:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}的确 我和你们看到的是不同的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}所持观点也是大相径庭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是 那个能自由自在说喜欢的自在世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}应该是我们共同追求的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}果然 还是不能达成一致吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.98,0:16:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}SSC！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}打扰你们享乐真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.66,0:16:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是我也有计划了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.09,0:16:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}突然出现了三台巨大物体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}最终会在游泳大会上发生什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.26,0:16:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}撤 撤离
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.61,0:16:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}在这时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你在想什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现在不是因伤害而难过的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好 大家一起上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.83,0:17:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}变身
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.18,0:17:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}泳装ver！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.57,0:17:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}大家 要上了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}明白
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.19,0:17:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}果 果然在水中还是不利啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.61,0:17:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸 你不打算帮她们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}要是没有那群家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}就不会是现在这样的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:18:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}但是 魔法少女们 明明那么努力地去战斗了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}如果不是在水下 这些家伙早就
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}你在说什么 这果然还是有点…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.51,0:18:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}大家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.82,0:18:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.77,0:18:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}高丁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.58,0:18:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}找到你真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.77,0:18:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}高丁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那是旧Popopi公司的原创豪华强者高丁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}现在流行的万万公司的高丁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}最初是由Popopi公司开发的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不过是大爆款豪华强者高丁的复刻版
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不愧是神田川
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}里面还沉睡着不得了的宝藏是也
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那些玩具吸收了我的特制药物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}所以某些条件下兴奋剂也是可以的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.67,0:19:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}旧时的东西被新事物所守护了…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}能自由自在说喜欢的自在世界
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}应该是我们共同追求的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.17,0:19:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}队长
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.04,0:19:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们必须先创造一个空隙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.64,0:19:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.49,0:19:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我是变态
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}咕噜咕噜哩 心跳妆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这是 难道
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}变身？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}怎么可能行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.57,0:20:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好 我们上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}必杀技
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}哦哇 有什么要出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.89,0:20:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}合体魔法 吸收了河中所有的水！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.17,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.54,0:20:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我可是受了不少伤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}做成刺身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这是面具舞者LD Box
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}这是VHD播放器
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}数不尽的宝藏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.51,0:20:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸 真的很帅是也
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.10,0:20:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}爸爸没事真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}让你担心了 爱蜜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:21:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}多亏了大家 我们才打倒了对手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}勇士高丁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.14,0:21:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}小时候的我 看了高丁的重播
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.27,0:21:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}就觉得真帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}那个时候 还不在乎是不是御宅族
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}喜欢的事物 就要自由自在地喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}果然我还是 想要和你们一起战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}希望你们别搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.59,0:21:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我们这次出手的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}消灭神田河中的恶魔 保护河中的历史文物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}不是帮助你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.38,0:21:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}即使那样 互相理解的那一天终会到来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.19,0:21:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}我会一直相信着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}城市的外面又是封闭着的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.83,0:23:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}是冰冻着的墙
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.13,0:23:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}在闭塞的心上凿洞 向心中注入新鲜空气
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}沉睡的圣地麦高芬
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.61,0:23:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}为了目的而攀登
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}事变再临
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur3}
